## Installation

### Via Composer

```bash
composer require [[ composer_name ]]
bin/console plugin:refresh
bin/console plugin:install --activate [[ plugin_class ]]
bin/console cache:clear
```

### Manual

1. Copy this plugin into `custom/plugins/[[ plugin_class ]]`
2. Run:
   ```bash
   bin/console plugin:refresh
   bin/console plugin:install --activate [[ plugin_class ]]
   bin/console cache:clear
   ```

